{{PCExclusive}}
'''Wise Empress Nobel''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

