==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Wise Empress Nobel is a pretty decent unit. Her freeze is very short considering her 12 second time between attacks, and her knockback may be detrimental versus [[Sunfish Jones]], but otherwise, she is a force to be reckoned with, especially against short-ranged Angel pushers. [[Angelic Gory]] and [[Gabriel]] would both be easily stopped in their tracks and knocked back, giving you some breathing room. On top of that, she has higher range than [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maiko]], allowing her to potentially freeze more targets like [[Angelic Sleipnir]]. Besides that, there are better options for [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] attackers.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

